Setting:{Eiyuu Senki game; Different time periods and empires exist at once, all rulers, heroes and combatants are female; Real world geographically, but with additional mythical lands and cities; Uruk has an ancient Mesopotamian aesthetic, with large ziggurats and historic vegetation rather than modern desert.}

Enkidu:{
